    "description": "Office Depot\n12-Pack Felt-Tip Porous Pens, Lot of 4\nMedium Point (1.0mm), Assorted Colors\nNew in Original Packaging\nThis collection features four individual 12-count packs of Office Depot brand felt-tip porous pens, representing a comprehensive palette for professional and creative use. Designed for precision and clarity, these pens deliver smooth, consistent strokes with a quick-drying ink formulation that resists smearing. The 1.0mm medium tips are engineered for bold writing and detailed creative work, featuring twelve distinct colors including black, blue, green, lilac, magenta, navy, orange, plum, purple, red, turquoise, and yellow.\nPrecise 1.0mm medium point felt tips designed for consistent line width\nQuick-drying, smear-resistant ink ideal for high-volume writing and organization\nSet of 4 blister packs, each containing a complete 12-color assorted palette\nCondition:\nNew and factory sealed in original retail blister packaging. The outer backing cards remain in excellent condition with no significant wear. All pens are unused and stored in their original state.\nPlease Note:\nThis is a pre-owned item being sold\nas-is\n. We do our best to describe items accurately and include research where possible, but we are not experts in every category. Please note that if the title or description states \"Tested\" that we only test to make sure the unit \"\nPOWERS ON\"\n.\nNo further testing takes place unless stated otherwise and items are considered untested.\nPlease remember all items are used and are sold as is, no refunds.If you have questions, please contact us before bidding.\nFor all vintage clothing, please research sizing before placing a bid.\nItems from different time periods may have measurements that differ from today’s standard sizing.\nCustomer Service:\nReach us via the “Contact Us” link above or by calling\n(540) 361-6550\n. Messages are handled Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM ET, and we strive to respond within 48 hours.",
